### Basic scaffold request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/zip

{
  "projectName": "my-cool-api",
  "basePackage": "com.goplan.demo",
  "framework": "SPRING_BOOT",
  "features": [
    "CONTROLLERS",
    "SERVICES",
    "REPOSITORIES",
    "DOCKER"
  ]
}

### Full request with models, services, repositories, controllers, and docker
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/zip

{
  "projectName": "my-lao-api-with-models",
  "basePackage": "com.goplan.demo",
  "framework": "SPRING_BOOT",
  "features": [
    "MODELS",
    "CONTROLLERS",
    "SERVICES",
    "REPOSITORIES",
    "DOCKER"
  ],
  "models": {
    "User": {
      "firstName": "string",
      "lastName": "string",
      "email": "string",
      "phone": "string",
      "age": "int",
      "createdAt": "date"
    },
    "Product": {
      "name": "string",
      "price": "double",
      "inStock": "boolean",
      "createdAt": "date"
    }
  }
}